data: {"id": "5354403c2c3a450a-thinking-parallel_evidence-1404", "run_id": "5354403c2c3a450a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 调查任务计划\n\n- **T1**: 确认 Pod 当前状态与容器重启细节（kubectl_get_yaml 已有，读取 raw 确认）。\n- **T2**: 读取 kubectl_describe raw 确认 Last State、Exit Code 和 Events（Oversight / probe failure / CrashLoopBackOff）。\n- **T3**: 查询 Prometheus 指标确认容器最近一次终止原因（OOMKilled 或 Exit Code 137）。\n- **T4**: 读取 kubectl_previous_logs raw 确认崩溃前的业务日志状态。\n- **T5**: 查询 Elasticsearch 日志，在崩溃时间窗内搜索 Error/SIGKILL/OOM/Panic 等关键字。\n- **T6**: 查询 DeepFlow tracing，确认异常退出前是否有异常 L7 流量或 trace。\n- **T7**: 查询 Pod Topology 确认 Owner/Node/Container 事实。\n- **T8**: 综合所", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788821095574, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

